Twitter, Facebook.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.199
And there is a piece of this story that is
distraction.

00:00:20.199 --> 00:00:22.720
And there's a piece of this story that is
projection.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.300
So let's talk about each.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:29.330
Donald Trump for a while has been saying Joe
Biden's performance against Bernie Sanders

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.820
during that debate, it was too good.

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:36.270
Biden must have been on something recently
saying that Joe Biden got a shot of something.

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:38.450
Remember this clip from last week?

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:39.600
The gloves off.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.550
This guy doesn't have a clue.

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.580
He doesn't know where the hell he is.

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.600
And they'll give him a shot at something.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.600
I don't know.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:47.600
He's going to get something.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.260
He'll be, you know, because I watched him
so badly.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:51.990
He performed so badly in the debates and then
with Bernie.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:55.510
He was average, not great, but he got through.

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:57.540
And I said, what the hell is he taking?

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:58.581
And we'd like to ask him.

00:00:58.581 --> 00:01:00.960
And I said that we want to drug test.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:05.519
We want to test the bouquet.

00:01:05.519 --> 00:01:07.360
There's the idea again.

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:13.260
And yesterday, Donald Trump again brings this
up by tweeting, quote, I will be strongly

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:20.480
demanding a drug test of sleepy Joe Biden
prior to or after the debate on Tuesday night.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:25.790
Naturally, I will agree to take when also
his debate performances have been record setting,

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:27.560
uneven, to put it mildly.

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.659
Only drugs could have caused this discrepancy.

00:01:30.659 --> 00:01:34.720
I continue to get the sense that there is
projection here.

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:40.170
Trump talking so much about performing better
in public speaking events because of drugs,

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:41.630
because of being on something.

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:46.440
And meanwhile, the speculation has been raging
for years that it's Trump who is on something.

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:52.770
And in reality, it is as specific as Trump
says in the tweets, but about himself.

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:58.530
It's Trump's public speaking performances
that are so uneven that it raises questions.

00:01:58.530 --> 00:02:06.500
We've casually called it upper Trump versus
Downer, Trump or Adderall, Trump versus Benzo

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:07.500
Trump.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:12.829
But the point is what Trump points out in
Biden, these uneven performances.

00:02:12.829 --> 00:02:17.420
That's exactly what has raised the alarm about
Donald Trump.

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:22.670
Trump sometimes a very sweaty with dilated
pupils, even in front of bright lights, talking

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:23.670
quickly.

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:28.879
Verbal glitches, the shoulder and the the
elbow spasms that we've noticed other times.

00:02:28.879 --> 00:02:30.889
It's a different person to different guy.

00:02:30.889 --> 00:02:32.189
It's a slowed down.

00:02:32.189 --> 00:02:38.599
Trump seems sad and low energy almost since
Ambulante like his sleep talking sleepwalking.

00:02:38.599 --> 00:02:41.310
So that's the projection piece that Trump
seems.

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:46.099
To be pointing out in Biden what we observe
in Trump, the distraction pieces that even

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:50.909
if Trump is on drugs, Trump must know that
there is not going to be an actual drug test

00:02:50.909 --> 00:02:52.950
before the debate or after the debate.

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:58.019
So he can tweet about it and talk about it
with no actual risk that he will be drug tested.

00:02:58.019 --> 00:02:59.879
And that is what is meant as distraction.

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:03.129
It's a distraction from, you know, pick your
poison corona virus.

00:03:03.129 --> 00:03:06.879
The tax story, his attempts to rig the election
in his favor.

00:03:06.879 --> 00:03:07.879
Whatever.

